  "id": "permission-inheritance-tree-bug",
  "title": "Permission inheritance tree with the buggy branch in red",
  "persona": "A full-stack engineer on a docs product, drawing how they think access is inherited from org to document while triaging a report that a restricted doc is visible to the whole team.",
  "topic": "how permissions inherit from the org down to a document",
